# Build the Android app after code changes

When you change anything under `android/` (Kotlin, resources, Gradle, manifests), **assemble an installable debug APK** before you finish. Compiling (`compileDebugKotlin`) is not enough.

From `android/`:

```bat
gradlew.bat :app:assembleDebug
```

Report the APK path when it succeeds: `android/app/build/outputs/apk/debug/TVTracker-v1.0.0-debug.apk`.

Skip the APK only when the change is purely website/Python with no Android files touched.
